    <system:String x:Key="String.Windows.Welcome.Guide.AppSupport.Description.1">Lyricify Fusion is applicable for all apps that support SMTC, which includes Spotify, Apple Music, Foobar 2000, Groove Music and even your web browser (browsers are disabled by default).</system:String>
